OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteers knit thousands of
OL,4,Aremembrance poppies
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of poppies have been knitted
OL,7,For crocheted and installed at two
OL,8,FSurrey churches ahead of Remembrance
OL,9,FSunday.
OL,11,FSt Mary's in Worplesdon has installed
OL,12,F2,000 flowers and St Alban's in Wood
OL,13,FStreet Village has installed 1,000
OL,14,Fafter the poppies were donated over six
OL,15,Fmonths.
OL,17,FJanet Sutton, who organised the
OL,18,Fneedlework effort, told BBC Radio
OL,19,FSurrey that more than 60 people
OL,20,Fcontributed since Easter.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
