OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteers knit thousands of
OL,4,Aremembrance poppies
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Communities up and down the country
OL,7,Fare doing this now and so I thought it
OL,8,Fwas time that we did something," she
OL,9,Fsaid.
